	"identifying_description": "Evening gown of black beaded net and black lace; 3/4 length white chiffon sleeves embellished with black lace and rhinestone chains; wide ribbon of black velvet brocaded with pink, green, and white floral across bust; straight skirt tucked into bodice at waist creating slight hobble effect; jet strands ornament skirt at center back and front princess seams; wide ribbon of black velvet brocaded with pink, green, and white floral below knee under black netting; green silk bows at side seam near hem; neckline, sleeve hem, and skirt hem trimmed with black fringe, jet beads; underskirt of embroidered cream chiffon; white satin lining.-Label: J.Baer, 1200 Geary, San Francisco",
